<title>USA: Sony to add 450 jobs in San Deigo by 1998.</title>
<headline>Sony to add 450 jobs in San Deigo by 1998.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp said it would spend $60 million to expand production capacity of its large-screen computer cathode ray tube with a new manufacturing line that will add more than 450 new positions to Technology Center, San Diego.</p>
<p>The company already has about 4,000 jobs at the center.</p>
<p>The expansion will bring total CRT production capacity at the center to about six million units per year, Sony said.</p>
</text>
